      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i think i have a UTI or something... it really burns when i go to the bathroom and i feel this constant pressure in my lower belly. i rly dont want to take antibiotics if i can help it. will taking a bunch of oregano oil capsules or like super concentrated cranberry stuff work to kill it off before it gets worse?",
